        <h2>The Miami Consulate: Jurisdiction and Location</h2>
        <p>Residents of Florida and eight other southeastern US jurisdictions apply for Spain's <a href="/digital-nomad-visa-spain/">Digital Nomad Visa</a> through the <strong>Consulate General of Spain in Miami</strong>. Located in Coral Gables at <strong>2655 LeJeune Road, Suite 400</strong>, the Miami consulate serves one of the most culturally connected Spanish-speaking regions in the United States, with deep ties to Spain and Latin America.</p>

        <div class="jurisdiction-card">
