        <h2>In-Spain Application: The Alternative Route for Florida Applicants</h2>
        <p>Given Miami's appointment backlog, Florida applicants frequently ask whether they can bypass the consulate by applying from inside Spain. The answer is yes &mdash; and for many Miami applicants, this is actually the preferred route.</p>

