            <p>Apply from Florida before moving. Appointment wait: 6&ndash;14 weeks. Processing after submission: 4&ndash;10 weeks. Results in a visa sticker in your passport. You then get a TIE card after arriving in Spain. Best if you are not planning to visit Spain soon.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="two-col-card">
            <h4>In-Spain UGE Route</h4>
            <p>Apply during a tourist visit to Spain. Often faster overall. Results in a residence permit directly (no separate TIE step needed). Same documents required. Ideal if you can visit Spain within your 90-day visa-free window and want to avoid Miami's long queue.</p>
          </div>
