        <p>Start your renewal 2&ndash;3 months before expiry. You will need updated income evidence, renewed health insurance certificate, updated criminal record check, and proof of continued residence and remote work activity. See our full <a href="/dnv-renewal/">DNV renewal guide</a>.</p>

